    "read": {
      "description": "held still and reading — a wave runs head to tail through the rings, each a beat behind the one in front of it, growing as it travels so the tail throws where the shoulders only breathe. Sampled twelve times a cycle and interpolated straight: the default ease is in-and-out, which brings a value to a stop at every keyframe it passes, and a body built out of fifteen of those stops together four times a second rather than moving. The head sways off the top of it and the mouth turns while it works. The body never leaves the spot.",
